  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 和那个买下万达的男人聊并购、写作与农民人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676d41791e823e72d3fe8053</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676d41791e823e72d3fe8053</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Dec 2024 11:58:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>还有人不知道单伟建是谁吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>即便你对这个名字陌生，但对他操刀的deal一定不陌生：韩一银行、深圳发展银行、腾讯音乐、盈德气体、珍爱网、大阪环球影城（USJ）、优然牧业，以及新达盟等等。并且，这些几乎都是控股并购型交易。因而很多人将单伟建称为“中国PE之王”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>并购是复杂交易能力的集中体现。但这样一个人们想象中的杀伐果断之人，却只爱喝白开水、会将衬衫穿到磨损、离开酒店会带走一次性拖鞋，以及自认底色是“一位农民”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这样的复杂和统一，是如何在同一个身上同时发生的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个月前，单伟建做客《倒带Rewind》，我们聊了聊宏观经济、中国并购、他的投资生涯，以及他最近几年的写作之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听《倒带Rewind》，我们一起探索商业世界的另一种表达方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾，单伟建，太盟集团 PAG 董事长</span></p><span></span><p><span>访谈，刘旌</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期，祝熹</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾BGM：《G大调》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>谈宏观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">00:04:12</a>政策应该起到四两拨千斤的效果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">00:08:43</a>房市好坏关系到千家万户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">00:14:11</a>我听到“出海”二字就不舒服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">00:15:21</a>从投资、出口依赖到消费依赖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">00:17:52</a>不顾一切地发展经济才是硬道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">00:18:53</a>中国经济的“最大风险”</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈写书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">00:26:32</a>《金钱风云》封面上的精心设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">00:28:28</a>不是在写自传，而是在填补一段空白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">00:31:28</a>写一本书和做一笔交易，兴奋感是相似的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">00:33:12</a>一个人一生能记住什么，是因为他们关心什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈并购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">00:34:44</a>只听楼梯响，不见人下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">00:37:17</a>中国并购难在能干的人太少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">00:44:53</a>运用之妙、存乎一心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2759">00:45:59</a>不一样的道路</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">00:47:03</a>为什么记性这么好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">00:49:45</a>“农民”意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">00:50:56</a>和五年前有何变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">00:51:05</a>假如发生了战争会如何自处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3275">00:54:35</a>跑步时在想些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">00:54:49</a>希望如何被外界评价？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>再访单伟建：白开水与金钱风云 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-t4-cHe3KwVEEWVr2q8ZnA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-t4-cHe3KwVEEWVr2q8ZnA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsrXu2CGW54CIAgzfGVbG0KFzgYD.m4a" length="81388393" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:04</itunes:duration>
