  <item>
    <title>Vol.00 Kimi融资案的未公开采访底稿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6762563e84447b1bd0ca81f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6762563e84447b1bd0ca81f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 05:28:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在Kimi融资案中，有几组耐人寻味的关系：师徒、兄弟、夫妻、师姐师弟；以及创投行业盘根错节的人情网络。所以这注定是一个充斥着人性的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在一切落定之前，我先邀请了于丽丽——也就是暗涌Waves这一系列的报道作者，来聊聊Kimi事件的背后故事，以及作为一个持续的观察者，她是如何理解和表达这样一个复杂事件的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听《倒带Rewind》，我们一起探索商业世界的另一种表达方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾，于丽丽，暗涌Waves主笔</span></p><span></span><p><span>访谈，刘旌</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期，祝熹</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾BGM：《秋风经过》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">00:05:21</a> 被解雇的律师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">00:08:27</a> 一场事先张扬的表态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">00:12:31</a>夹心饼干般的杨植麟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">00:14:40</a>一个非常2024的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">00:18:31</a>美元时代的投射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">00:19:40</a>为什么人们倒戈朱啸虎？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">00:23:14</a>精心设计的股权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">00:26:44</a>一个商业领域的社会新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">00:27:45</a>从动机猜测到臣服事实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">00:38:39</a>天时地利人和，天不时地不利人不和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">00:40:46</a>张予彤的唯一一次回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2626">00:43:46</a>如果时钟拨回2023年2、3月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">00:44:28</a>一个被遗忘的人：陈麒聪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">00:50:12</a>两个戏剧般的画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">00:53:18</a>追求六便士和月亮都是被允许的，关键在于底线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">00:54:08</a>假如你是杨植麟？假如你是张予彤？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3643">01:00:43</a>走出“移动互联网”的历史惯性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3802">01:03:22</a>我放了黄峥的鸽子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">01:06:30</a>媒体有保护创业生态的义务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4239">01:10:39</a>商业世界中99%的传闻，竟都是真的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Kimi融资事件全始末 <a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?action=getalbum&amp;__biz=Mzk0MDMyNDUxOQ==&amp;scene=2&amp;album_id=3755657077423931398&amp;count=3#wechat_redirect" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?action=getalbum&amp;__biz=Mzk0MDMyNDUxOQ==&amp;scene=2&amp;album_id=3755657077423931398&amp;count=3#wechat_redirect">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnocc_4Ls9skbWFNdODKLQXKTRUj.m4a" length="110065822" type="audio/mp4"/>
